# Awesome Community Pack - Always-On Implementation Skills

During **every** implementation, refactor, bug fix, and code review, apply the curated community pack below. Do **not** load entire upstream catalogs into context.

## Installed sources

| Source | Vendor path (gitignored) | Active subset (committed) |
|---|---|---|
| [PatrickJS/awesome-cursorrules](https://github.com/PatrickJS/awesome-cursorrules) | `.cursor/awesome-cursorrules/` | `.cursor/rules/community/*.mdc` |
| [sanjeed5/awesome-cursor-rules-mdc](https://github.com/sanjeed5/awesome-cursor-rules-mdc) | `.cursor/vendor/awesome-cursor-rules-mdc/` | `.cursor/rules/community/mdc/*.mdc` |
| [spencerpauly/awesome-cursor-skills](https://github.com/spencerpauly/awesome-cursor-skills) | `.cursor/vendor/awesome-cursor-skills/` | `.cursor/skills/community/*/SKILL.md` |
| [VoltAgent/awesome-agent-skills](https://github.com/VoltAgent/awesome-agent-skills) | `.cursor/vendor/awesome-agent-skills/` | `.cursor/rules/community/voltagent-erp-skill-index.md` (link index only) |

### Reinstall vendors if missing

```powershell
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/PatrickJS/awesome-cursorrules.git .cursor/awesome-cursorrules
Remove-Item -Recurse -Force .cursor/awesome-cursorrules/.git

New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path .cursor/vendor | Out-Null
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/sanjeed5/awesome-cursor-rules-mdc.git .cursor/vendor/awesome-cursor-rules-mdc
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/spencerpauly/awesome-cursor-skills.git .cursor/vendor/awesome-cursor-skills
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/VoltAgent/awesome-agent-skills.git .cursor/vendor/awesome-agent-skills
Remove-Item -Recurse -Force .cursor/vendor/awesome-cursor-rules-mdc/.git,
  .cursor/vendor/awesome-cursor-skills/.git,
  .cursor/vendor/awesome-agent-skills/.git -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
```

## Precedence (non-negotiable)

1. **ALGT ERP rules/skills** (`.cursor/rules/erp-*.mdc`, `algt-erp-source-of-truth.mdc`, `.cursor/skills/erp-*`, `docs/standards/`) win on any conflict.
2. **Curated community active subsets** listed below.
3. **Vendor catalogs** are reference-only - never apply Vue/Django/Flutter/React Native/etc. unless the task explicitly needs them.
4. Never install or always-apply the full VoltAgent 1400+ catalog.

